1
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:02,920
Lingling.

2
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:05,280
I found where the door is.

3
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:05,880
Really?

4
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:07,200
Then let's run.

5
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:09,039
But the stone door has a mechanism.

6
00:01:09,039 --> 00:01:10,640
I haven't found where it is yet.

7
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:12,300
I know where the mechanism is.

8
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:13,600
Where?

9
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:15,000
I can tell you.

10
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:16,520
But when you escape,

11
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:17,640
you must take me with you.

12
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:18,520
Don't worry.

13
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:19,640
After I get out,

14
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:21,360
I will bring the police to save you.

15
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:23,160
What if you run away and don't come back?

16
00:01:23,160 --> 00:01:24,039
Take me with you.

17
00:01:24,039 --> 00:01:25,480
I don't want to die here.

18
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:27,160
I will definitely come back to save you.

19
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:28,560
No whispering.

20
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:30,000
Get back to work.

21
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:44,800
We are from the Phoenix Police Department.

22
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:46,560
A wanted criminal ran here.

23
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:47,580
Did you see him?

24
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:50,000
We didn't see him.

25
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:51,460
Search.

26
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:53,120
I'd like to see who dares.

27
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:53,650
Officer.

28
00:01:53,960 --> 00:01:55,080
Are you going to search my uncle's house

29
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:56,080
for no reason?

30
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:57,120
Uncle.

31
00:01:57,479 --> 00:01:58,280
Don't be afraid.

32
00:01:58,280 --> 00:01:59,240
With us here,

33
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:01,440
no one dares to touch a hair on your head.

34
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:04,680
You dare to openly oppose the police department.

35
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:06,340
Do you know the consequences?

36
00:02:25,079 --> 00:02:25,480
Where is it?

37
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:26,810
The exit is right there.

38
00:02:32,320 --> 00:02:34,560
I thought you really wanted to leave here.

39
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,120
I didn't expect your awakening

40
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:38,720
to be just a tool for someone else's dirty work.

41
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:40,640
I knew

42
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:42,880
you wouldn't give up.

43
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:44,360
Let's see where

44
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,760
you can run this time.

45
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:46,960
Senior Sister.

46
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:47,920
Violating the sect's rules

47
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:49,840
should be publicly tried by the Venerable.

48
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:51,770
You can't use private punishment.

49
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:56,960
This is what the Venerable told me to do.

50
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,560
This time,

51
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:00,160
don't even think about using it again.

52
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:01,720
Trying to fool me with the trick of the Heavenly Lord's possession.

53
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:02,600
No.

54
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:05,760
Siyao.

55
00:03:06,320 --> 00:03:06,980
Don't move.

56
00:03:09,720 --> 00:03:10,560
Are you okay?

57
00:03:11,160 --> 00:03:11,960
How is it?

58
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:13,860
Did you find any clues?

59
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:17,720
Come with me.

60
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:20,980
Don't move.

61
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:24,440
You really are the envoy sent by the Heavenly Lord.

62
00:03:26,079 --> 00:03:27,320
You must remember,

63
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,840
it's not over yet.

64
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:38,160
Report.

65
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:38,820
Come in.

66
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:41,200
Superintendent Li.

67
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:41,840
This is

68
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:44,370
an urgent letter sent by Special Envoy Huang.

69
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:51,320
What happened?

70
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:53,640
Huang Xianzhong bypassed Zeng Guoquan

71
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:57,100
and applied to the headquarters for Jiang Siyao's promotion.

72
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,960
Then is Jiang Siyao no longer suspended?

73
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:01,400
The suspension investigation letter issued by the city government

74
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:03,120
doesn't need to be reported to the headquarters.

75
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:04,360
But the orders from the headquarters

76
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:06,560
must be executed by our police station.

77
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:08,020
Then...

78
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:10,380
What position is she promoted to?

79
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:11,600
Superintendent,

80
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:12,720
in charge of operations.

81
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:14,240
Who has a higher rank between you two?

82
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:14,770
She does.

83
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:17,130
What is your original name?

84
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:19,040
I forgot.

85
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:20,120
Forgot?

86
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:22,720
How long have you been in the Jingxiang Society?

87
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:23,880
The exact time,

88
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:26,720
I don't remember either.

89
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:28,840
Then why did you help the people of the Jingxiang Society

90
00:04:28,840 --> 00:04:29,960
persecute others?

91
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:32,200
I was forced.

92
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,640
If I didn't do this,

93
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:36,120
I would be beaten,

94
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:37,680
locked up,

95
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:39,120
and burned to death.

96
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:39,920
Then,

97
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:42,000
who founded this organization?

98
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:44,520
It's the Master.

99
00:04:44,520 --> 00:04:45,400
The Master?

100
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,200
Who is the Master?

101
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,120
I don't know who he is either.

102
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,560
He always wears a mask.

103
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:53,760
I have never seen his true face.

104
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,480
Besides wearing a mask,

105
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:57,600
is there anything else special about him?

106
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,640
He

107
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:02,000
only appears at the base to preach

108
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,520
on the 15th of every month.

109
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:06,040
But he didn't come this month.

110
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:07,960
Let me ask you.

111
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,280
My necklace,

112
00:05:09,280 --> 00:05:10,680
is it in your hands or not?

113
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:13,100
I put it in the storehouse that night.

114
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:14,960
I didn't touch it.

115
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:18,120
You still have a chance to turn over a new leaf.

116
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:19,000
What is it?

117
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,730
Who is the Teaching Venerable?

118
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:23,320
And,

119
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:26,860
why do the villagers of Baxian Village keep his secret?

120
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:28,920
Okay.

121
00:05:30,640 --> 00:05:32,120
I will tell you

122
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,659
everything I know.

123
00:05:37,320 --> 00:05:39,159
Can you stop taking risks alone?

124
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,720
Isn't that what being a cop is about?

125
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,880
You're a cop now too.

126
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:46,540
I'm not talking about the job.

127
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:51,560
You're avoiding me.

128
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:52,080
I'm not.

129
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:53,440
Jiang Siyao.

130
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:55,900
Do you have nine lives?

131
00:05:56,760 --> 00:05:57,560
Ye Shi'an.

132
00:05:59,159 --> 00:06:00,760
On my wedding day, my fiancé

133
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:01,640
died tragically,

134
00:06:01,640 --> 00:06:03,570
and then my father passed away too.

135
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:05,580
I only have one belief in my heart,

136
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,920
which is to find the real killer

137
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:07,920
and avenge them.

138
00:06:08,520 --> 00:06:09,160
So?

139
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,560
So don't waste your time

140
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,400
on me.

141
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,480
Even for revenge, you shouldn't

142
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:14,640
throw your life away.

143
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:15,960
You have things you want to do.

144
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:17,560
I have things I want to do too.

145
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:20,450
Then you don't need to worry about me anymore.

146
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:31,120
Sir.

147
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,040
Yao.

148
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,320
This time,

149
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,560
you really made a great contribution.

150
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,159
If it weren't for your strategizing

151
00:06:37,159 --> 00:06:38,720
and restoring my position,

152
00:06:38,760 --> 00:06:39,920
I wouldn't have solved this case

153
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:40,920
so smoothly.

154
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:43,360
This case has already

155
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:44,920
caused a huge uproar.

156
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:46,720
The General Bureau has issued an official document

157
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:48,400
demanding a thorough investigation.

158
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:50,000
I will not let you down.

159
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:53,120
That's why I asked the General Bureau

160
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:55,560
to advance your promotion.

161
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:58,480
Now the foreigners and churches in the concession

162
00:06:58,480 --> 00:07:00,280
also want to intervene in this case.

163
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:02,680
They will send someone to contact you immediately

164
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:04,240
for a joint investigation.

165
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:05,920
Once this case involves foreigners,

166
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:07,480
the problem will be very serious.

167
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:10,200
In this chaotic world,

168
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:11,680
sometimes

169
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:14,640
you have to learn to play dumb.

170
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,040
Sir,

171
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:17,640
are you saying...

172
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:19,600
In Lei Lie's case,

173
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:22,280
Li Chengrui definitely has some problems.

174
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,120
But

175
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:25,090
in the Jingxiang Society case,

176
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:27,040
he was willing to step in

177
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,720
and save you from trouble.

178
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:30,280
Ayao,

179
00:07:31,080 --> 00:07:32,280
he who chases the deer

180
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:34,040
does not see the hare.

181
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:35,600
I will put up with him.

182
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:38,060
Because I always feel that behind him

183
00:07:38,280 --> 00:07:39,640
there is a big shot.

184
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:41,560
Extra! Extra!

185
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:44,360
Ta Kung Pao front page headline.

186
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:48,220
Fenghuang Police Station busted a mysterious organization.

187
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:50,000
Extra, extra!

188
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:53,040
You were so cool this time, Senior.

189
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:54,800
Even Special Commissioner Huang praised you.

190
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,120
If you ask me,

191
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,560
let's go have a big meal tonight

192
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,560
to celebrate.

193
00:07:59,440 --> 00:08:00,300
Captain Jiang,

194
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:01,320
hurry back to the police station.

195
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:03,380
Someone from the higher-ups is here.

196
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,360
Today is a good day.

197
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,680
I'm here to be a witness.

198
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,880
From today on,

199
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:11,480
the Fenghuang Police Department and the British Concession Police

200
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:13,480
officially make peace.

201
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:15,240
Thank you, Mr. Huo,

202
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:17,040
for stepping in as a peacemaker.

203
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:19,520
Being a peacemaker is too tiring.

204
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:21,170
If it weren't for

205
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:23,000
Mayor Zeng coming to my residence in person...

206
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,640
I had to give him some face,

207
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:25,560
right?

208
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,320
Especially since

209
00:08:26,320 --> 00:08:27,720
your Chief Inspector Zhu

210
00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:29,200
is an old acquaintance of mine,

211
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:29,920
right,

212
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:31,210
Superintendent Li?

213
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:32,600
Yes, yes, yes.

214
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:33,730
Superintendent Li.

215
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:35,640
I'm sorry about what happened last time.

216
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:36,500
What happened?

217
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:38,240
I've forgotten all about it.

218
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,120
Inspector Jiang.

219
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:42,640
No,

220
00:08:42,640 --> 00:08:43,520
Deputy Chief Jiang.

221
00:08:43,520 --> 00:08:44,320
We meet again.

222
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:46,650
Inspector Zhou,

223
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,880
how do you have time today

224
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:50,440
to visit our Fenghuang Police Department?

225
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,280
Officer Huo,

226
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:53,400
if you can visit friends at my place,

227
00:08:53,400 --> 00:08:54,720
can't I come here?

228
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,160
Welcome, welcome.

229
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:58,320
All police officers are one family.

230
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:00,520
Inspector Jiang,

231
00:09:00,520 --> 00:09:02,250
you always see the big picture.

232
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,000
Look, I almost forgot

233
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,460
such an important matter.

234
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:08,160
Today, entrusted by Mayor Zeng,

235
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:10,640
I officially announce that

236
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:11,400
from now on,

237
00:09:11,800 --> 00:09:12,720
Inspector Zhou Wei.

238
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:13,160
Present!

239
00:09:13,160 --> 00:09:15,720
Under the orders of the British Concession Police,

240
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:17,720
together with the Fenghuang Police Department,

241
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:20,360
you will jointly investigate the Jingxiang Society's xenophobia case.

242
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:20,890
Yes, sir.

243
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:23,600
It's getting late.

244
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,760
I have matters to attend to at home.

245
00:09:24,760 --> 00:09:25,680
Inspector Jiang,

246
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:27,200
I'll take my leave now.

247
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:29,600
You guys talk.

248
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:30,320
You guys talk.

249
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:30,920
Goodbye.

250
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,020
Farewell, Mr. Huo.

251
00:09:34,160 --> 00:09:35,160
Stop right there.

252
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:37,500
I was wondering who it was.

253
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:40,000
So it's you,

254
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:42,680
the banana, yellow on the outside and white on the inside.

255
00:09:42,680 --> 00:09:43,720
Officer Huo.

256
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:45,920
You really have a knack

257
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,320
for making cynical remarks.

258
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:47,800
Enough.

259
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:50,320
Since we are going to cooperate,

260
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:51,780
let's talk about the case.

261
00:09:51,920 --> 00:09:53,880
Is there anything you need help with?

262
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:55,600
What we need to do right now

263
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:57,000
is to catch Qian Yanqing.

264
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:59,040
Since it's a joint investigation,

265
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:01,480
we will also send a representative to assist you.

266
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:02,160
Then,

267
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,720
we'll send Officer Huo Yining

268
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:05,850
to assist you with the investigation.

269
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:13,480
Who are you looking for?

270
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:15,360
Hello, we are police officers from the Fenghuang Police Department.

271
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:16,760
We heard that the master of the Jingxiang Society

272
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:18,160
is preaching here.

273
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:20,120
We'd like to ask a few questions.

274
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:22,780
How do I know you are from the police department?

275
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:27,480
Ask whatever you want.

276
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:29,520
What does this master look like?

277
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:32,400
I haven't seen this master's true face.

278
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:34,520
He's about thirty years old.

279
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:36,040
He has a local accent.

280
00:10:36,160 --> 00:10:37,960
How long has it been since you saw this master?

281
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:40,000
The last time the master came

282
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,600
was about a month ago.

283
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:44,000
Okay, thank you. Thank you.

284
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:49,440
I think you're

285
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:50,920
just full of hot air,

286
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:52,560
bragging.

287
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:57,200
Then you're just biting off more than you can chew.

288
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:59,200
Just wait to be proven wrong.

289
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:04,440
Watch out!

290
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:09,490
I didn't mean it.

291
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:11,920
Pervert!

292
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:15,000
I was protecting you.

293
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:17,360
You took advantage of me and still act innocent, huh?

294
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,800
Whoever wants to take advantage of you can go ahead.

295
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:19,800
I certainly don't want to.

296
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:21,280
Saving my life

297
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:23,440
is a blessing earned by your ancestors.

298
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,680
You should be thankful.

299
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:25,160
You!

300
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:28,800
Let's go.
